    <briefdescription>
<para>Class used for BIP39 recovery strategy. User can set b64 encoded passphrase and key variant (only &quot;cardano&quot; is supported for ed25519 currently) for bip32 seed generation. It can also hold the mnemonic sentence from master seed generation. </para>
